# Brno-anything hand channel, 2026-08. Membership-test first: would a Brno
# reader recognise the bare word as Brno with the clue covered? Scores are the
# editorial grade: 200 unmistakable, 171 solid (the tugendhat grade), 150
# borderline (nationally common or name-bound; the fill may still take them,
# the clue voice carries the Brno signal at zero search cost).
# NOT here: words whose only Brno-ness lives in the clue (drak, kolo, tunel,
# nádraží, výstaviště-adjacent carriers) — those are the clue channel.
zbrojovka;230
kometa;200
starobrno;200
parnas;200
anthropos;200
mendel;200
koliště;180
stiassni;171
jurkovič;171
löwbeer;171
morgal;171
reduta;171
dornych;171
ponava;171
pekařská;160
lajbl;160
trojka;150
era;150
momenta;150
sono;150
# cafes that read as themselves, venue-established (not magazine-attested;
# the city-magazine archive barely reviews cafes, which is a corpus gap,
# not a membership gap)
skog;200
placzek;200
zemanova;200
šalinkarta;200
# local nicknames the magazine archive cannot attest (it writes official names)
zelňák;260
moravák;200
boby;200
štětl;200
